{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_title", "source_sha256": "b8c425bfa8585ddd2e4e716d7ff1e1ca6a1df4233c3d150f9c9cd435a6b9d7be", "ja": "ライブMC　～即席ツッコミコンテスト～", "zh": "演唱会主持　～即席吐槽比赛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a1e1b28f770bcd0743334b907df54dbc6099eb1f1966ab69a32281e6e059634f", "ja": "のり子を飛ばしてMCを締めようとする瑞希に\r\nのり子は鋭いツッコミをいれる。対抗心を燃\r\nやした奈緒は、琴葉にボケを要求し、本場の\r\nツッコミを披露。続いて、瑞希が挑戦しよう\r\nとするが、MCは終わりの時間を迎えた。", "zh": "瑞希跳过法子，准备为演唱会主持做结尾，\n却受到法子犀利的吐槽。燃起对抗意识的奈绪\n要求琴叶装傻，并且表演了道地的吐槽。\n接着瑞希也想挑战，然而主持谈话已到了\n该结束的时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "83195d108129f9844892c04aafecacf6c58e977e5bf3deea239bdba4d806db42", "ja": "はあ～、歌った歌った！　メッチャ気持ちいいわ～。\nみんなー！　ここまでの私らの曲、どうやったー？", "zh": "呼～唱了好多歌呀！超舒畅的～\n大家──！唱到现在的歌曲都好听咩──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "0414c7e1bdf95cd0432351d19ec1e48cbe90a04f12ee6e1ebf93285b6d592f0b", "ja": "サイコーッ！！！", "zh": "超好听──！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "1e389a17165764e391e4e890e3cd21d5f145e240331d0991bec5f24d3f16e22c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　みなさんに\nそう言ってもらえて、私たち、とてもうれしいです！", "zh": "谢谢！能听到大家这么说，\n我们也很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "5dbf215b1379a16cc1f6989e9591fa64a050a7c7837116d0e0b1c04f94f2ffa2", "ja": "この後も、まだまだライブは続きます。引き続き、\nみなさん楽しんでいってください。……次の曲、ごー。", "zh": "演唱会还没结束喔，接下来，\n请大家继续享受……下一首歌，Go～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "fe980a1acaa9e2d038069072d06d8223ab22e415e0fb30fa4445719365854504", "ja": "って、MC終わらせちゃダメじゃん、瑞希！　次の曲の\n準備がまだだし、そもそもアタシ一言も喋ってないし！", "zh": "呃，不可以擅自结束主持啦，瑞希！\n下一首歌还没准备好，而且我根本一句话都还没有说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "bd9cdf0fe4897a974d892e57a5111907eab37753bc96a5228b80ec3529bb7dd4", "ja": "はっ。すみません。流れでつい、締めてしまいました。\n……反省だぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "啊！对不起，顺势就做结尾了。\n……会反省喔，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "44f204c259ee4fd30621c69903585e2cdf115cd89a553ab99f4dab02704c8446", "ja": "っていうか、のり子、今のツッコミすごいやん！\nタイミングといいキレといい、絶妙やったわ！", "zh": "是说法子，你刚才的吐槽好厉害呀！\n不论时机跟犀利度都堪称一绝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "4b5cf09865c0a54be9acaabc7b91a29e0b1e3cf745bbb57317f032a50e12e61a", "ja": "そ、そうかな？　意識してやったわけじゃないから、\nホメられるのも変な感じだけど……えへへ。", "zh": "是、是吗？我不是刻意吐槽的，\n这样就被称赞感觉也有点怪……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "bcd620506401d3c26df04b1bbbf67361fe81ce3942b60ab588c3ad196f6f8140", "ja": "無意識なら余計すごいわ。私も、関西人として負けて\nられへん。琴葉、何かボケてや！　私がツッコむから！", "zh": "不是刻意的话就更厉害了，身为关西人，我也不能输啊。\n琴叶，你装傻一下吼！我来吐槽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "3d3e78ef644a2b10bb71f3d2412f0c587cfdb46c7cacc076f767101908ca88d2", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、そうね…………。\nふ、布団が吹っ飛んだ？", "zh": "咦！？这、这个嘛……\n有个人叫做小蔡，然后他就被端走了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "28c3c7faf630c453f752f077c3658b9629826a213fa2a5ff0ff5b28344b172b9", "ja": "どんな状況やねん！　布団はなかなか吹っ飛ばんわ！\n……どうや？　バシッと決まったやろ？", "zh": "这是什么状况呀！人怎么会被端走啦！\n……怎么样啊？是不是吐槽得一针见血？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1013_audience", "source_sha256": "c462e16087f167d224e2f70e5690d58a7ad3cf6f08ac0504435c3bce99ac844a", "ja": "パチパチパチパチパチ！", "zh": "（掌声响起）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "4d05e749e90ccd8992c09eb31fef9bb8af31cabf98d2c07458d24c76e58c6c24", "ja": "さすが奈緒！　切れ味バッチリだね！\n本場のツッコミ、聞かせてもらったよ！", "zh": "不愧是奈绪！太犀利了！\n让我们听到了道地的吐槽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "4679fa92ee4a5901613a9fdc406d685277261678fe7747f0ca1bf020c01c2a5d", "ja": "それでは次は、私がツッコミに挑戦します。\n田中さん、ボケてください。……プリーズ。", "zh": "那么，下一个换我来挑战吐槽。\n田中姊，请装傻……拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "31a4a86487af1e3af403cc46f4c44c0585147a4debc031bc7af78390679a763b", "ja": "え、また私？　え、え～と……。あれ？\n{$P$}が呼んでる……え、もう時間？", "zh": "咦，又是我吗？呃，我想想……哎呀？\n{$P$}在叫我……什么？时间到了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_10_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "b0c95d91aaa9ab513fc81dd9df4ba2fc080e23be8c2972a69016723b78cd471f", "ja": "つ、次の曲の準備が整いました！　みんな、用意は\nいい？　それでは、盛り上がっていきましょう！", "zh": "下、下一首歌已经就绪了！大家准备好了吗？\n那么，我们一起嗨起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
